          title: "Moshi / Arusha – Ngorongoro Crater – Nainokanoka – Walking to Olmoti Crater",
          summary: "We will pick you up from your hotel at 0800 and depart for Ngorongoro Crater, descending for game viewing and a tour of the crater with a picnic lunch in the crater. Ascend to the rim and proceed to Nainokanoka Village campsite where you have dinner and overnight. You may hike to Olmoti Crater rim for about 1.5 hours and Mungu Waterfalls before dinner and overnight at the camp. Crater Tour: 3-4 hours (Optional) | Walking time: 1-2 hours | Walking Distance: About 2 km | Altitude : Nainokanoka/Olmoti ↑ ↓ 300 m",
